'''Part 1: Adventurer Cats''' (第1章 ネコたちの冒険, ''Dai 1 Shō Neko-tachi no Bōken'', '''Chapter 1 The Cats' Journey''') is an event added in the [[Version 13.0 Update]] as part of the [[Anniversary/11th Year|11th Anniversary]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Part 1: Adventurer Cats will reset when the event ends. The bosses of this Gauntlet are many common enemies that the player encounters during main progress.

==Overview==
===About===
Chapter 1 The Cats' Journey contains a total of 20 stages. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for each stage completion are Small Medals which can be used on the [[Medal King's Palace (Event Gacha)|Medal King's Palace]] Event Gacha.

